; The records room - filing cabinets, and a desk whose drawer's keypad wants the code from the nurses' station.

[[Palette
  [[Lino [0.3 0.33 0.31 1]] [Paint [0.55 0.55 0.5 1]] [Dado [0.3 0.3 0.28 1]] [Wood [0.36 0.3 0.24 1]] [Files [0.4 0.42 0.38 1]] [Keypad [0.12 0.12 0.12 1]]]]

 [Area
  [[Type [Hospital Records]]
   [Name "Records"]
   [Ambient 0.75]
   [Probe [0 1.6 0]]
   [Bounds [[-3.5 -0.5 -3] [7 4 6]]]
   [Songs [[[Song HospitalPoweredSong] [When [Some [Flagged PowerRestored]]]] [[Song HospitalSong]]]]]]

 [Layout [Chamber [[Size [6 5]] [Floor Lino] [Walls Paint] [Dado Dado]]]]

